Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical HU
	The Hungary Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - HU" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is     | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is     | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is     | High                        |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Brazil                      |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Spain                       |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is     | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - HU" should have the following properties under the any conditions
