Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical US
	The US Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is          | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is          | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is          | High                        |
	| Support Region             | Is not      | Brazil                      |
	| Support Region             | Is not      | Spain                       |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is          | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not      | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not      | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	| Sub Organization           | Not present |                             |
	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US" should have the following properties under the any conditions
	| Within (schedule) | Is | US - Schedule         |
	| Within (schedule) | Is | US - Weekend Schedule |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US" should have "11" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - US - Platinum Critical"

Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical DXP Cloud JP AU
	The JP/AU DXP Cloud Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - JP/AU" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type       | Is     | Create                      |
	| Support Region    | Is not | Brazil                      |
	| Support Region    | Is not | Spain                       |
	| Product           | Is not | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product           | Is     | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	| Support Region    | Is not | India                       |
	| Within (schedule) | Is     | JP - Schedule               |
	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - JP/AU" should have the following properties under the any conditions
	| Priority | Is | High   |
	| Priority | Is | Urgent |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - JP/AU" should have "9" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - JP/AU" should assign the ticket to the "group" "DXP Cloud - JP/AU"

Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical DXP Cloud HU
	The HU DXP Cloud Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - HU" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is           | Create                      |
	| Support Region             | Is not       | Brazil                      |
	| Support Region             | Is not       | Spain                       |
	| Product                    | Is not       | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is           | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	| Support Region             | Is not       | India                       |
	| Priority                   | Greater than | Normal                      |
	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - HU" should have the following properties under the any conditions
	| Within (schedule) | Is | HU - Schedule         |
	| Within (schedule) | Is | HU - Weekend Schedule |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - HU" should have "9" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - DXP Cloud - HU" should assign the ticket to the "group" "DXP Cloud - HU"

